Package: fireprint
Title: Explore Australia's Changing Fire Detection Patterns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Shakshi", "Shah",
           email = "ssha0414@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reproducible tools and an interactive Shiny
    application for comparing satellite-detected fire activity across
    selected periods of Australia's 2019-2020 fire season. Users can
    examine changes in detection counts, geographical distributions,
    and spatial concentration using prepared NASA FIRMS MODIS data.
